{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍对过去受的委屈感到不服气，但已经争累了；离开那些人后，想起过去又觉得空落和难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈、失落、想念、被刺痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"不服气如何逐渐消退、旧日记忆可能指向某个人或故乡、两只手像夜色中的影子，以及音乐从柔和克制到压力加深的变化，都需要逐句读。后半段的躁动、不安和疲惫也不容易一眼捕捉。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还在和过去的委屈较劲，却逐渐意识到自己已经离开那些人，想起从前只剩难受和失落。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈、怀念、失落、刺痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"音乐中柔和歌唱背后的压力、旧日记忆重新变得温暖、眷恋中带着失落，以及快速音型逐渐放缓的过程，都不是扫一眼就能建立联系的内容。下半部分音符变化也没有直接帮助理解人物处境。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他对过去仍有不甘，但已经没有力气继续争辩；离开后才发现心里空了，想念又让他难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不甘、委屈、空落、眷恋、疲惫\",\n      \"missed\": \"旋律失去依托、只剩一个声音自己说话，以及最后几次深呼吸所表达的紧绷暂时松开但并未真正释怀，需要读完整段才能理解。人物情绪和这些音乐画面之间的对应关系不够醒目。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上半屏最影响扫读的是把人物经历、情绪变化和音乐画面全部放进同一字号、同一视觉权重的超长段落里。第一眼虽然能抓到不服气、离开后的失落和想念的刺痛，但不知道应该优先抓住哪一层。右上角两条短句本来可以承担情绪总结的作用，却字号较小、位置靠边，视觉上不足以成为明确的阅读入口。内容本身有一条从过去的不甘、离开后的失落，到怀念与疲惫的情绪线，所以串联性尚可；主要问题是扫读时很难同时抓住人物处境、感受和音乐画面。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "77aaca56-6e4e-4be6-b7c0-4592cf8bb33a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010309061852Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:04:00.873956+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67aaf8cdbba3f55cda083973831aea5f147e4293e0ca86f68431c79783d8defd", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010309061852Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "68749d7e7b712066db34a3d479005bd99dba6305016ab6606bd13dfb632401b6"}}}
